sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Developer / AI agent
  participant UI as React dashboard
  participant API as FastAPI<br/>(main.py)
  participant S as Service orchestrator<br/>(service.py)
  participant CX as ContextService +<br/>WorkspaceManager
  participant M as CAVR · SATRA · SABLE<br/>analyzers
  participant ST as Store + EvidenceBus<br/>(SQLite, hash-chained events)
  participant G as Final gate<br/>(final_gate.py)

  U->>UI: start run (manual, watch or replay)
  UI->>API: POST /api/runs
  API->>S: create(scenario / source, SRS, plan, policy)
  S->>CX: snapshot candidate workspace, baseline, applicable modules
  S->>ST: save RunContext, emit run.created
  API-->>UI: 202 Accepted (run id)
  S->>S: analyze() in a background thread
  loop each applicable module
    alt inputs byte-identical to valid earlier evidence
      S->>ST: reuse evidence (evidence.revalidated)
    else inputs changed
      par in parallel (ThreadPoolExecutor)
        S->>M: analyze(context)
        M-->>S: status, details, residual uncertainty
      end
      S->>ST: store Evidence (candidate snapshot, input hash, status, blocking flag)
    end
  end
  S->>G: decide(applicable, evidence, snapshot, input hashes)
  G-->>S: ACCEPT / BLOCK / REVIEW + reasons
  S->>ST: emit final_gate.changed
  alt ACCEPT
    S->>CX: reconstruct clean workspace (fresh Git clone + verified files)
  else BLOCK or REVIEW, auto-repair on
    S->>M: bounded repair proposal, re-verified by the modules
  end
  UI->>API: GET /api/runs/{id}/stream, /evidence, /report
  API-->>UI: live events, evidence, final decision, report
